                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 Potsdam/7–3045</note>
                <head>No. 770<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Proposal by the British
                    Delegation</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Babelsberg</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-07-30">July 30, 1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Austrian Reparations</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">British Proposal</hi></p>
                <p>Reparations will not be exacted from Austria. Removal of plant and equipment and
                    other goods from Austria as war booty or
                    otherwise will, in future, be a matter to be settled by the Control Council.</p>
            </div>
